      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Sleep Apnea Dentist in Dublin – Dr Dante Gonzales Orthodontics"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At our clinic you’ll find dedicated service for sleep apnea alongside the usual orthodontic care. Being a sleep apnea dentist in Dublin, we focus on helping people whose breathing repeatedly stops and who suffer poor sleep quality night after night."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "That interrupted sleep may seem harmless but it isn’t. It can raise high blood pressure, lead to cardiovascular issues and affect your whole health and daily energy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Schedule Your Sleep Apnea Consultation",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "dublin-ca-orthodontic-office-contact.php",
          "text": "Schedule Your Sleep Apnea Consultation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "What is Obstructive Sleep Apnea & Why It Matters"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "When you lie down, your throat muscles and soft tissue may relax too far back, the airway narrows and you stop breathing for a few seconds."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "That is typical of obstructive sleep apnea. There is also central sleep apnea where the brain doesn’t send signals to breathe, but our clinic more often treats the obstructive type."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "These sleep-related issues can cause loud snoring, morning headaches, or waking with a choking feeling. Over weeks and months the low oxygen levels strain your heart and lungs. Without accurate diagnosis and care, the risk of heart attack, stroke or worse rises."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/img/logo2.png",
      "alt": "Logo",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Want to know if you’re a candidate for braces or Invisalign?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Take Our 30-Second Quiz Now To Find Out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Take Quiz Now!",
      "links": [
