      "text": "What to Expect During Your Visit"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "You’ll fill out a questionnaire about your sleep, snoring, waking patterns. That’s how we begin. Sometimes it feels a bit awkward, but we make it comfortable."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "We take scans, check your jaw, airway and alignment."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "We discuss your treatment options, show expected outcomes."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "We schedule your next appointment and arrange monitoring of your progress, taking care to track oxygen levels, sleep quality and comfort."
    },
